But he'll eat you in a single bite today.

263
00:19:29,767 --> 00:19:31,467
I don't care about your cat!

264
00:19:33,327 --> 00:19:35,127
All I care about is them!

265
00:19:35,487 --> 00:19:36,667
Turn them back now!

266
00:19:36,987 --> 00:19:40,067
Did you hear how that savage is speaking for the snake, princess?

267
00:19:40,067 --> 00:19:41,567
It's Carolyn from Liv, Bakura!

268
00:19:47,567 --> 00:19:48,747
Now, Bakura!

269
00:19:49,207 --> 00:19:50,127
Eat her!

270
00:19:59,767 --> 00:20:23,387
Eat her!

271
00:20:23,387 --> 00:20:45,867
He's strong. He just knocked Bhakura out with a single blow.

272
00:20:47,627 --> 00:20:49,827
And he didn't even use any haki.

273
00:20:50,207 --> 00:20:52,167
That was just brute strength.

274
00:20:52,167 --> 00:20:54,187
What the hell is wrong with all of you?

275
00:20:56,187 --> 00:20:57,667
That woman up there.

276
00:20:59,427 --> 00:21:02,027
She turned three of your own people into stone.

277
00:21:02,127 --> 00:21:04,667
How can you just sit up there and laugh like that?

278
00:21:04,787 --> 00:21:05,547
I never.

279
00:21:06,147 --> 00:21:09,207
That little savage has the gall to shout at us.

280
00:21:09,247 --> 00:21:11,647
Oh, don't let her to him. He's just an animal.

281
00:21:11,967 --> 00:21:13,527
Sure, I feel sorry for those three.

282
00:21:13,727 --> 00:21:16,367
But the Snake Princess had every right to do what she did.

283
00:21:16,367 --> 00:21:18,367
Of course. It was justice.

284
00:21:18,767 --> 00:21:20,467
They violated the law of our land.

285
00:21:20,467 --> 00:21:25,847
But what you don't understand is that I'll be forgiven for anything I do.

286
00:21:26,587 --> 00:21:27,727
Absolutely anything.

287
00:21:28,907 --> 00:21:32,027
And the reason why is because I'm beautiful.

288
00:21:32,027 --> 00:21:45,167
Just look at me. I'm sure you must agree.

289
00:21:45,887 --> 00:21:47,407
Actually, you make me sick.

290
00:21:50,127 --> 00:21:51,527
Stay strong, sister.

291
00:21:51,527 --> 00:21:53,607
This simply cannot be happening.

292
00:21:54,087 --> 00:21:56,547
There's no man alive that can resist my allure.

293
00:21:56,667 --> 00:21:57,907
It's just not possible.

294
00:22:02,627 --> 00:22:06,587
So long as that man exists in this world, I shall never know peace again.

295
00:22:06,787 --> 00:22:09,207
How dare you hurt the Snake Princess like that?

296
00:22:09,387 --> 00:22:11,307
Make the man suffer for his crimes.

297
00:22:11,647 --> 00:22:12,627
Execute him!

298
00:22:12,627 --> 00:22:16,187
Execute! Execute!

299
00:22:16,187 --> 00:22:21,227
Marigold, Sandersonia, defend my honor and take his head.

300
00:22:22,227 --> 00:22:24,687
Execute! Execute!

301
00:22:25,147 --> 00:22:26,227
You got it.

302
00:22:26,307 --> 00:22:28,007
We'll get the job done, big sis.

303
00:22:28,007 --> 00:22:41,687
So these girls have powers too.

304
00:22:41,687 --> 00:22:45,887
Execute! Execute!

305
00:22:45,887 --> 00:22:47,567
Execute!

306
00:22:47,567 --> 00:22:49,327
Execute!

307
00:22:49,327 --> 00:22:51,087
Execute!

308
00:22:51,087 --> 00:22:52,747
Execute!

309
00:22:52,747 --> 00:22:54,367
Execute!

310
00:22:54,367 --> 00:23:09,847
When Empress Hancock orders her sisters to execute Luffy,

311
00:23:10,087 --> 00:23:13,487
they transform into fearsome serpents and begin a deadly assault.

312
00:23:13,487 --> 00:23:18,147
Luffy fights for his life, but soon discovers that the two women have a mysterious ability

313
00:23:18,147 --> 00:23:21,927
that allows them to slither through all of his attacks unharmed.

314
00:23:21,927 --> 00:23:27,627
On the next, One Piece, a difficult fight for Luffy, the Snake Sisters' hockey power.

315
00:23:28,127 --> 00:23:29,827
I'm gonna be king of the pirates!

